      "id": "claim_45a8435fd4d34f05bd759e8dc55f0454",
      "statement": "Structured output enables obtaining data from language models in a well-defined, type-safe format through three complementary patterns: native structured output via with_structured_output() on chat models, explicit output parsing via BaseOutputParser subclasses, and streaming structured output that progressively yields partial objects.",
