          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5669c169d4d9dd26ccaadbea957eac3a492777611f47c450f992dac26317f291:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b536363906a14d3fb260de6b698f2bc2",
      "statement": "The agent framework provides specialized error types for structured output via tool strategies: StructuredOutputValidationError is raised when tool arguments fail schema validation, and MultipleStructuredOutputsError when the model returns multiple tool calls when only one is expected. These errors carry the ai_message and can trigger retries with error context sent back to the model.",
      "evidence": [
